{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Countdown Log 讓你可為生日、紀念日、婚禮、考試和旅行等重要日子建立倒數，無需帳戶，資料僅存於裝置。適合學生、情侶、家庭及重視私隱的使用者；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-186.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線私密倒數管理</h2>\n<p>加入事件時可設定類別、顏色與備註，並即時查看剩餘日數；重要日期可置頂及設定每年重複。主頁提供排序、搜尋與篩選，日曆以月檢視所有事件，另備日期計算器、節日瀏覽、年度進度與統計等功能。App 以離線優先運作，無網絡亦可使用，資料保存在本機，並內建 15 種語言。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-222-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-223-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-224-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-225-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-226-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Countdown Log – Days Until</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/countdown-log-days-until/id6767731218?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:57:08.061957+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":299,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T00:08:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:00:28.195247+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T00:50:33.981827+00:00","content_hash":"50de437dfdcf808ce37952e6ee36efcbc6ea4f1edcf1ff9093943d8a275a79ee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}